</event>

<event name="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_DIALOGUE">
    <text>"No way. No way you did this. No way you found… ANOTHER LEAH? What about us? What about our rivalry, the most legendary rivalry to ever exist, and you found ANOTHER me? I thought we had something special, we've fought each other so many times, had so many amazing moments and you... you... you cheat on me!" Leah slams her fist down onto the table and leaps from her seat. "No more games, captain! Our rivalry is over, and only one of us is going to make it out of here alive! ..Ooh, but what if we both died at the same time, wouldn’t that make for such a cool and epic mo-"</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Close communications and charge your weapons.</text>
		<event load="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_START_COMBAT"/>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue listening.</text>
		<event load="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_DIALOGUE_2"/>
	</choice>
</event>

<event name="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_DIALOGUE_2">
    <text>"-ment? I mean, just think about it! Wouldn't it be so cool to have our legendary rivalry, which you ended, you beyatch, end with both of our deaths? Like one of those death-to-alien-races morality videos you see all the time, it'd be one of those epic themes about how violence is only sometimes the answer, and- Ooh! We can include one of those 'it's about the journey, not the reward'-type of deals as well! Don't you think that'd be such a fitting end to our rivalry, by the way, you're still a beyatch for that, since it spanned so long, we might as well include th-"</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Close communications and charge your weapons.</text>
		<event load="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_START_COMBAT"/>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Close communications and charge your weapons.</text>
		<event load="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_START_COMBAT"/>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue listening.</text>
		<event load="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_DIALOGUE_3"/>
	</choice>
</event>

<event name="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_DIALOGUE_3">
    <text>"-ose to wow our audiences. Wait, don't get me wrong, our rivalry wasn't for the fame, but it was such a long and legendary rivalry, we might as well share it, right? And so I'm thinking, when people hear about our rivalry, I want them to go 'wow, that was deep', you know? I mean, we both put so much effort into this, so I really want it to be fulfilling for both of us, except for you beyatch, you're still a beyatch, like beyatch, you replace ME? ME!? WITH ANOTHER LEAH!?" Leah slams her fist down onto the table again. And sits down to leap up from her seat again. "This is ridiculous! You can't ju-"</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Close communications and charge your weapons.</text>
		<event load="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_START_COMBAT"/>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Close communications and charge your weapons.</text>
		<event load="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_START_COMBAT"/>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Close communications and charge your weapons.</text>
		<event load="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_START_COMBAT"/>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue listening.</text>
		<event load="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_DIALOGUE_4"/>
	</choice>
</event>

